# Пакеты C++ и Perl и переходные «пустышки» из trixie пинят точную версию
# imagemagick-7-common и -dev-пакетов своей версии, поэтому рядом с нашими
# они остаться не могут. Разбор - в README.md.
Conflicts: imagemagick-doc,
           libimage-magick-perl,
           libimage-magick-q16-perl,
           libimage-magick-q16hdri-perl,
           libmagick++-7-headers,
           libmagickcore-dev,
           libmagickwand-dev,
           libmagick++-dev,
           perlmagick
Description: image manipulation programs -- infrastructure
 imagemagick-common contains the filesystem infrastructure required for
 further installation of imagemagick in any configuration; it does not provide
 a full installation of binaries, libraries, and utilities
 required to run imagemagick.
 .
 This package is independent of channel depth.

Package: libmagickcore-7-headers
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: libdevel
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: low-level image manipulation library - header files
 The MagickCore API is a low-level interface between the C programming language
 and the ImageMagick image processing libraries and is recommended for
 wizard-level programmers only. Unlike the MagickWand C API which exposes only
 a few opaque types and accessors, with MagickCore you almost exclusively access
 the structure members directly.
 .
 This package includes the architecture independent header files
 needed to compile programs using MagickCore.
 .

Package: libmagickcore-7.q16-10
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         imagemagick-7-common (>= ${source:Version})
# Пакет "-extra" из trixie зависит от этой библиотеки лишь с ">=", но несёт
# кодировщики djvu/exr/wmf/svg/pango, собранные под ImageMagick 7.1.1: наш
# 7.1.2 их никогда не загрузит (в пути модулей есть версия апстрима). Поэтому
# все кодировщики едут внутри этого пакета, а старый -extra уходит.
Conflicts: libmagickcore-7.q16-10-extra, libimage-magick-q16-perl
Replaces: libmagickcore-7.q16-10-extra, libimage-magick-q16-perl
Description: low-level image manipulation library -- quantum depth Q16
 The MagickCore API is a low-level interface between the C programming language
 and the ImageMagick image processing libraries and is recommended for
 wizard-level programmers only. Unlike the MagickWand C API which exposes only
 a few opaque types and accessors, with MagickCore you almost exclusively access
 the structure members directly.
 .
 This package contains the C libraries needed to run executables that make
 use of MagickCore, including every coder and filter module.
 .
 This version of libmagickcore is compiled for a channel depth of Q16.

